@startuml
title Weather Forecasting Module : View Current Weather

actor "Traveller" as Actor
participant UI as ":weatherDetails"
participant Ctrl as ":weatherController"
participant Weather as ":openMeteoAPI"

Actor -> UI: Select View Current Weather
UI -> Ctrl: Request Current Weather
Ctrl -> Weather: retrieveCurrentWeather(destinationCoordinates)
Weather --> Ctrl: Current Weather
alt [Current weather available]
  Ctrl --> UI: Display Temperature Condition Rain And Wind
else [Current weather unavailable]
  Ctrl --> UI: Display Unable To Load Current Weather
end

@enduml
